{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Step into the vibrant and colorful world of Spire Blast!</strong> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Join forces with your loyal, ever-hungry dragon companion as you set out to collapse mysterious towers rising across the kingdom. Conquer colorful puzzles, tackle mind-bending challenges, and bring towers crashing down in a dazzling burst of fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Master physics-based puzzles, unleash powerful boosters, and test your wits in a wide range of unique challenges. Whether you're a casual gamer looking for a relaxing adventure or a puzzle enthusiast hungry for more, Spire Blast offers hours of fun and colorful chaos!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore stunning environments, unlock new towers, and discover the magical charm of this puzzle experience. With its captivating visuals and satisfying gameplay, Spire Blast is perfect for players of all ages.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engaging Puzzle Mechanics:</strong> Blast bricks to match colors and cause chain reactions to bring down the tower piece by piece.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/01.gif?t=1744696090\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Gameplay:</strong> Think ahead! Each shot impacts the structure and balance of the tower, so plan carefully to create the most efficient collapses.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/02.gif?t=1744696090\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging Levels:</strong> With every level, the tower's design becomes more complex, and new brick types introduce fresh challenges to overcome.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/03.gif?t=1744696090\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relaxing Yet Addictive:</strong> Easy to pick up, but tricky to master\u2014<i>Spire Blast</i> offers a soothing puzzle experience with layers of depth for those who want to truly perfect their strategy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352260/extras/04.gif?t=1744696090\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Vibrant Visuals &amp; Sound:</strong> Enjoy colorful, minimalist art and a calming soundtrack that perfectly complements the satisfying destruction of the tower.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you bring the Spire down to its foundations? Test your logic, timing, and creativity in this unique puzzle challenge!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352260/4e2a2509b2bab4bb42daa0e814d20f8d1f0585b9.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352260/9b672dd019e9e4121b198fc9d9abf47a8908a17c.jpg"},{"name":"First, but not last","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352260/5e2356cea5f8f2582a72f3bf8bf3bd3df3a1fc3b.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping spree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352260/cfe98221b6f97eea89a880920fcda21a11d41890.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon's friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352260/7b6c1e33af8f4de1120ab9a0bb86fbf5cee7b4cd.jpg"},{"name":"Tower Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352260/865fa81c56401a88264a28f6b106c75a4432e436.jpg"},{"name":"Ball breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3352260/a1ddc3e603372c04a6a545ef8444057ddf3151c6.jpg"},{"name":"Don't hit the shi